# Env file for the `lineleader` git-backed dockhand stack.
#
# THIS FILE IS THE DEPLOY TRIGGER. dockhand polls this repo on a cron
# (see deploy/README.md) and loads this file as the stack's env file.
# Bumping the version below and pushing IS how a release is rolled out —
# there is no separate "set it in the dockhand UI" step for this value.
#
# Do NOT put secrets in this file: the repo is public, so anything here
# is public too. AUTH_SECRET is supplied as a dockhand stack variable
# instead (encrypted in dockhand's DB), never committed here.
LINELEADER_VERSION=v0.2.1
